{"baseRefName":"develop","baseRefOid":"b111dbbed9c250c0bcf3afe1c754819b30eae935","body":"## 治理元数据\r\n\r\n- **PR 类型**: feature\r\n- **任务 ID**: M5-006\r\n- **风险等级**: R2\r\n- **责任人**: @Chengyue-Lu\r\n- **工作流目录**: docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M5-SYSTEM-EVALUATION-DESIGN\r\n\r\n## 范围与非目标\r\n\r\n实现 ADR-0020 与 Issue #55 已接受的 M5-006 六个切片，使冻结的评估输入可以逐跳重算并拒绝对象替换、未知证据与过度解释。\r\n\r\n- Protocol 固定 A1/A2→M6、A3→M11 Core、A4→Skill extension，primary A4−A2 包含 transport 差异；注册设计、指标四态、盲审/reveal 与三层 decision hierarchy。\r\n- A2/A3 qualification exact 连接 frozen/runtime Task、Requirement、Supply/component/implementation/interface 与 A3 Method；只允许 ceiling 等价或收窄。\r\n- admission overlap 由外部 Protocol 固定准入闭包、调用方固定 confirmatory cases/time，独立重算 case/Task/input/oracle 的 identity-or-hash intersection。\r\n- A4 overlay 固定 candidate/evaluation→具名 Decision→Release/显式 promotion→Projection→Supply→Snapshot→Bundle→View；Python API 必须消费独立 admission verifier。\r\n- pairwise 比较完整接口 I/O、非 Skill 表面、执行 binding、输出/停止义务，重算三态与 preregistration；当前合成 Method 差异得到 package effect。\r\n- 8 个独立版本记录进入 SchemaCatalog/validation；新增 `rwb eval verify`、正反测试、coverage 映射与实施/交接文档。\r\n\r\nM5-003 / Skill Evaluation v0.1 保持原语义。本 PR 的范围截止 M5-006：M6-008、Skill closeout Gate、M5-007、真实 case/admission/live execution 仍按各自 Gate 推进；没有真实实验或发布操作。\r\n\r\nRefs #55\r\n\r\n## 契约与权威影响\r\n\r\n- **共享契约**: yes\r\n- **权威、权限或数据边界**: yes\r\n\r\n新契约属于 Maintainer/Evaluation 输入。校验器验证输入资格与解释上限；执行、Supply selection、Human admission、Claim acceptance 继续由既有 owner/边界控制。Private oracle 字节只在授权的评价侧校验。\r\n\r\n## TASKS 状态变更\r\n\r\nM5-006: READY -> DONE\r\n\r\n这是实现 PR 的状态提议；共享接受仍受 required checks 与 cross-owner review 约束。Task 定义与依赖未修改。\r\n\r\n## 验证证据\n\n### M5-006 最终集成验证\n\n当前 head `303133a330149d1d62698d4dc063a871216636ac`，base `b111dbbed9c250c0bcf3afe1c754819b30eae935`，tested merge target `af3fbba66680f67dce40bcba075acdb3ca4e5bec`。本次合入已接受 PR69/73，仅解决 TASKS 辅助导航的真实冲突，保留已关闭 M4 的准确 Gate 表述与 M5-006 实现索引。\n\n[最终 CI 34689902122](https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/actions/runs/34689902122) 10 项检查全部通过；[同 head governance 34689902094](https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/actions/runs/34689902094) 通过。双 Python 各 1213 PASS，coverage 1187 PASS，零 skip/error/failure；global line 93.69%，47 个 critical 满足 95/90、11 项 impact 完整。plan SHA256 `2bfc1bd853b2bfea4a43cbe9fd26fe0fcbdac9443173feccd221358c7d95794c`；raw receipt `6e95998aea4e610dcde2a9a8b80d595d503ea2deb0d2cf8c327b6e984ca6bdda`。本地只运行了受文档冲突影响的一项链接检查，未重复 full、coverage、安装或模型测试。\n\n以下 d59346d 与更早结果保留为历史证据，不替代以上最终集成候选。\n\n### 历史验证证据\r\n\r\nM5-006 当前 head `d59346d5a653a6012fa7364e60f836915d55d502`，base `ab98caf25125e6567d8bb2c8afff02105b54c940`（已合入 PR70），tested merge candidate `ee76e926f224e1f3c41487966d89358ea0f57727`。head / target tree 相同。Range-diff 保留 15 个 M5 提交的 patch，只有 Schema-test 的基线上下文变化；全部 185 个既有 M5 archive 文件在旧 head、新 head、工作区逐字节一致。\r\n\r\n[当前 CI 34688362311](https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/actions/runs/34688362311) 全部通过，plan digest `a0f927d415bda4f3074900f43b5c0d4b87ac3d11b34353f7e8770634cdf5930f` 已复算，full + impact/repository coverage、11 个 impact 文件、0 blocked reasons。下载结果逐项绑定以上 head/base/target/plan。\r\n\r\n- **Python 3.11 full 1204 PASS / 0 skip；Python 3.13 full 1204 PASS / 0 skip；coverage 1178 PASS / 0 skip。** 三组均包含 M5 focused 67/67 PASS。\r\n- PR70 的 ordered behavioral/coverage execution 在 Python 3.11 完整顺序运行 1204 项，再从相同 receipt 验证 full 和 1178 项 coverage 义务；不是两次独立 full 执行。本次独立重算 `_project_execution` 与两个下载结果完全一致，source receipt digest `205799e861b2666f38a1b442fd59f893ceab9f28d78a29ed1e43be8d4a69f465`。producer 耗时 568.474 s；Python 3.13 full 耗时 308.480 s。\r\n- Global source line **93.69%**；7 个 M5 模块行/分支均 **100%**，11 个 impact 文件的 changed lines/branches 无遗漏；governance checker line **98.06%** / branch **97.60%**。\r\n- Repository **186 validated / 0 errors / 0 warnings**；Python 3.11/3.13 × direct/sdist-wheel × isolated/normal 共 **8 组 package smoke PASS**，每组 132 resources / 84 schemas / 0 production projections，资源清单 hash 一致。\r\n- Documentation 和 governance PASS。当前 head 本地 M5 focused **67 PASS**（109.850 s），文档/Schema **15 PASS**，diff check PASS。Governance 首轮因 PR 验证段落漏写 task ID 被拒；补齐 M5-006 后复检通过，代码与政策未更改。\r\n\r\n历史 head `3723630` / base `1cb0c19` 的 CI 34670209343 与黄毅批准保留为原修复证据；新集成证据以上述当前 run 为准。Trace REVIEW-003 无 BLOCK，仅保留已披露的 TRACE-CAPTURE-DELAYED。多 Task 验证保持独立正反组合回归范围，不扩写为多 Task 科研执行。\r\n\r\n## 剩余风险与后续\r\n\r\n当前 head 的既有 CI 检查已全部通过，已向 @let778750-cpu 请求当前集成候选的复核；PR71 由人工决定合入。M5-006 合入后由黄毅推进 M6-008 baseline envelope / A2 qualification / replay closeout；可并行通过独立 docs-only task-definition 建立 Skill-bearing generic closeout replay seam 的实施身份，再实现 Gate B。M5-007 保持 BLOCKED，直到 M6-008 DONE 且 Gate B SATISFIED；下一实现里程碑是 synthetic four-arm Harness proof。真实 case、M6-004 live 与 production A4 admission 继续约束 M5-004；M14 公共文档、M12/M13 不追加为 M5 前置。具体节点已同步到 [Issue55](https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/issues/55#issuecomment-5645349712)。不自行合并或发布。\r\n\r\n## 权威依据\r\n\r\nM5-006 的既有 Task 定义、ADR-0020 exact pin 与已闭合 Gate A。路诚钺拥有评价语义和共享契约；黄毅评审 transport/Host producer-consumer 接口。真实案例、Skill admission、科研判断和发布决定仍保留给相应具名人类 owner。\r\n\r\n## 对抗性证据\r\n\r\n拒绝 structural/fixture Snapshot、自报 qualification/eligibility、实现/接口/案例替换、权限扩大、过期时间、缺失或未知 oracle/Task/input、assessment 重写、Human status-only admission、Projection/promotion 错绑、合法重建但改变模型的 View、伪造 exact-skill-only、preregistered ref 漂移及缺失测量填零。新增模块纳入 critical coverage 与独立正反 evidence mapping，不降低阈值。\r\n\r\n\r\n本次 review 修复：confirmatory Protocol 在 schema/semantics 两层强制 exact admission-scoped closure；A3/A4 从冻结 Task/Method 推导完整 Requirement 集合并要求每项恰好绑定一次；唯一 Skill extension 按 Projection pin、Skill ID/version/hash 去重。测试覆盖 null、错误 scope/hash、缺项、额外绑定、重复、Task/Method 不一致和同一 Skill 跨两项需求复用。现有 Method 差异仍产生 package effect。\r\n\r\n最新 cross-owner review 修复：完整 A3 qualification 与全部 Bundle/View 校验完成后，按 A4 overlay 的 exact Task FileReference 选择 A3 子集，并重验其 frozen Method/Requirement completeness。其他已合格 Task 不参与该 case 的 paired surface；Method 差异仍为 package effect。接入 PR68 后同步实现索引、模块说明、STATUS、开发地图与施工导航；M6-008、Skill replay、Harness、真实 case/live/admission Gate 保持独立。\r\n\r\n\r\n","files":[{"path":"docs/DEVELOPER_ARCHITECTURE_MAP.md","additions":9,"deletions":8,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/M_SERIES_IMPLEMENTATION_MAP.md","additions":7,"deletions":7,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/ROADMAP.md","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/STATUS.md","additions":4,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/TASKS.md","additions":2,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/implementation/README.md","additions":5,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/implementation/SYSTEM_EVALUATION_PROTOCOL.md","additions":182,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/modules/10-OBSERVABILITY_EVALUATION_COST.md","additions":5,"deletions":5,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M5-SYSTEM-EVALUATION-DESIGN/ENTRY_PLAN.md","additions":131,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M5-SYSTEM-EVALUATION-DESIGN/README.md","additions":4,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M5-SYSTEM-EVALUATION-DESIGN/RISK_LEDGER.md","additions":23,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M5-SYSTEM-EVALUATION-DESIGN/WORKLOG.md","additions":105,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M5-SYSTEM-EVALUATION-DESIGN/attempts/M5-006-IMPLEMENTATION-001/.gitattributes","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M5-SYSTEM-EVALUATION-DESIGN/attempts/M5-006-IMPLEMENTATION-001/ACTORS.yaml","additions":15,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M5-SYSTEM-EVALUATION-DESIGN/attempts/M5-006-IMPLEMENTATION-001/INDEX.yaml","additions":187,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M5-SYSTEM-EVALUATION-DESIGN/attempts/M5-006-IMPLEMENTATION-001/README.md","additions":13,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"}